title:
Substitute for HB 2512 by Committee on Elections - Relating to
advance voting ballots; requiring county election officers to provide at least
four hours of advance voting in-person on the Saturday before an election;
providing after January 1, 2025, such ballots cast in-person be received in the
county election office by 7:00 p.m. on the Sunday proceeding the election;
exception to allow voting in-person until 12:00 noon on Monday for good cause.

Abolishing
the current wildlife and parks;
commission; creating a new Kansas wildlife and parks commission;
granting appointment authority to multiple state officers; authorizing the
commission to elect a chairperson.
